    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_1X34YGdTiaOe2G2",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID30",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Task_description",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<h2>Task description</h2>\n\n<br>In this task, you will be shown a label from the EDOS taxonomy and a short paragraph taken from a report.<br><br>Your task is to assess the&nbsp;<strong>Context Relevance</strong>, i.e., if the paragraph contains information that is needed to answer to the harm defined by the EDOS label.",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Task_description",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Task_description",
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "GradingData": [],
        "Language": [],
        "NextChoiceId": 9,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "QuestionID": "QID30"
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_1X34YGdTiaOe2G2",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID31",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Q4108d3a46ee46dcb-chunk_371445a7ea454e971118f066",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>EDOS Label</strong></p><p><strong>1.1 threats of harm</strong> – Expressing intent, willingness or desire to harm an individual woman or group of women. This could include, but is not limited to: physical, sexual, emotional or privacy-based forms of harm.</p><br><p><strong>Paragraph</strong></p><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">1.2. Defining cyber violence and hate speech online against women > 1.2.2. Academic and civil society definitions > Sexist hate speech<br><br>Sexist hate speech is defined as expressions which spread, incite, promote or justify hatred based on sex.\n\n<sup>31</sup> This section builds on the definitions presented earlier in the study and draws on definitions proposed in the following reports: Internet Governance Forum (2015), “Online Abuse and Gender-Based Violence Against Women”, available at https://www.intgovforum.org/multilingual/content/online-abuse-and-gender-based-violence-against-women, as well as the database produced by the Women’s Media Center, “Online Abuse 101”, available at http://www.womensmediacenter.com/speech-project/online-abuse-101\n____________________________________________________________________________\n\nPosting and sharing violent content consist of portraying women as sexual objects or targets of violence.\n\nUse of sexist and insulting comments, abusing women for expressing their own views and for turning away sexual advances.</div><br>",
        "DataExportTag": "Q4108d3a46ee46dcb-chunk_371445a7ea454e971118f066",
        "QuestionType": "MC",
        "Selector": "SAVR",
        "SubSelector": "TX",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Q4108d3a46ee46dcb-chunk_371445a7ea454e971118f066",
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "0 - Not relevant"
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "1 - Partially relevant"
          },
          "3": {
            "Display": "2 - Relevant"
          }
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [
          "1",
          "2",
          "3"
        ],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "ForceResponse": "ON",
            "ForceResponseType": "ON",
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "Language": [],
        "NextChoiceId": 4,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "QuestionID": "QID31"
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_1X34YGdTiaOe2G2",
